{"kind": "candidate", "round": 1, "trial": 1, "parent_sha256": "3c091a179115c94483017a515719fef8ba50e80f813da2add6274f040fef8215", "proof": "open OldExpressions in\ntheorem substOldPostSubset:\n  (Imperative.HasVarsPure.getVars (P:=Expression)\n    (substOld h2 (Lambda.LExpr.fvar m h1 ty) post)).Subset\n    (Imperative.HasVarsPure.getVars (P:=Expression) post ++ [h1]) := by\n  have o2 : ∀ {A B a b S : List Expression.Ident}, A ⊆ a ++ S → B ⊆ b ++ S → A ++ B ⊆ a ++ b ++ S := by grind\n  unfold Imperative.HasVarsPure.getVars\n  induction post with\n  | const _ _ | op _ _ _ | bvar _ _ | fvar _ _ _ => exact List.subset_append_left _ _\n  | abs _ _ _ ih => exact ih\n  | ite _ c t f ic it iff => exact o2 (o2 ic it) iff\n  | quant _ _ _ tr e iq ie => exact o2 iq ie\n  | eq _ e₁ e₂ i₁ i₂ => exact o2 i₁ i₂\n  | app _ fn arg ifn ia =>\n      unfold substOld\n      split\n      · split\n        · exact List.subset_append_right _ _\n        · assumption\n      · exact o2 ifn ia", "edits": [{"start": 510, "end": 520, "replacement": "exact ih", "reason": "library_search"}], "evaluation": {"status": "passed", "scores": {"length_reduction_pct": 51.75718849840256, "heartbeat_reduction_pct": 79.85498644458664, "compatibility_pct": 100.0, "combined_pct": 77.20405831432974}, "candidate": {"length": 151, "code_sha256": "a8d8ee0c60f59f1647db7b1b876fb58ce5d24b226e8fece55c1327545c1b67a9"}, "primary_version": "v4.26.0", "per_version": {"v4.26.0": {"status": "passed", "passed": true, "heartbeats": 1042.664, "heartbeat_reduction_pct": 79.85498644458664, "cached": true, "environment_fingerprint": "1a8f53d9ef6597e59d732b68310b09a673952277c2d77779e33c0c96670f4486", "elapsed_seconds": 4.324378738179803, "diagnostics": []}}}, "primary_upper_bound": 77.20405831432974, "all_versions_requested": false, "improves_incumbent": false}
